{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Steam Deck-compatible demo of the first 60-90 minutes of Danchi Days. Your save data does not carry over into the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Revive the forgotten summer festival!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Hoshino revive the forgotten summer festival! Turn strangers into neighbors by surfing the NeighborNet, playing minigames, and uncovering some slightly interesting secrets around her <i>danchi</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Huh? What\u2019s a <i>danchi</i>? Basically, a place with a lot of neighbors! Or, more dryly, a Japanese mass housing complex. What kind of quirky people live in Hoshino\u2019s <i>danchi</i>? Ho ho\u2026 only one way to find out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/extras/EN1.png?t=1747812731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn strangers... into neighbors!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It can be tricky to get an RSVP from the neighbors. Like Sizz the Egg Sizzler: who requires you to eat an egg fried on a hot metal slide before even considering coming to the festival. Or Krysta Rippley, a puddle fanatic who will only accept your invite after playing in the mud together. Then there's Pete Sweep, an old man who doesn\u2019t even notice you because he is\u2026 sweeping leaves.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/extras/EN2.png?t=1747812731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Browse The Internet!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Dad made a special kind of internet just for neighbors \u2014 NeighborNet. Search keywords to find pages to surf, and discover more about the strangers living in your <i>danchi</i>. Play minigames, or just \u201cSay Hi!\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/extras/EN3.png?t=1747812731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Minigames! Explore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before she had dementia, Grandma taught me that in order to appreciate the small moments in life, I need to play special puzzle minigames. Bumping into flowers to smell them, collecting beads of condensation from iced tea, and listening to poo being flushed away\u2026 it\u2019s these sensations that make up my very life in the <i>danchi</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/extras/BOTH4.png?t=1747812731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Moro-Q</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes! Festival Assistant Moro-Q is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/extras/EN5.png?t=1747812731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312850?t=1747812731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312850?t=1747812731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/47767599c82f5854e73917ba24fdaa4c44d34ad0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747812731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312850/47767599c82f5854e73917ba24fdaa4c44d34ad0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747812731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Steam Deck-compatible demo of the first 60-90 minutes of Danchi Days. Your save data does not carry over into the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Revive the forgotten summer festival!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Hoshino revive the forgotte